[ID 43] Testing: Sample delivery status breakdown (delivered, acknowledged, returned) by brand in 2025
Determined intent: data_handler
Instantiated handler: DataHandler
[DataHandler] Tables identified: {'DIM_Time', 'FACT_Sample_Management', 'FACT_Interactions', 'DIM_Brand'}
[DataHandler] SQL Generated: SELECT 
    DB.brand_name, 
    SUM(CASE WHEN FSM.sample_status = 'DELIVERED' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS delivered, 
    SUM(CASE WHEN FSM.sample_status = 'ACKNOWLEDGED' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS acknowledged, 
    SUM(CASE WHEN FSM.sample_status = 'RETURNED' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS returned
FROM 
    FACT_Sample_Management FSM
JOIN 
    DIM_Brand DB ON FSM.brand_id = DB.brand_id
JOIN 
    DIM_Time DT ON FSM.time_id = DT.time_id
WHERE 
    DT.year = 2025
GROUP BY 
    DB.brand_name
